OL,3,GNEWSAPlaid aim for new Wales-based FTSE
OL,4,A100 company within 10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Plaid Cymru government will create
OL,7,Fthe economic conditions for another
OL,8,FWelsh company to join the elite FTSE
OL,9,F100 share index within a decade, the
OL,10,Fparty has said.
OL,12,FOn Saturday, Enterprise Minister Adam
OL,13,FPrice will set out targets for 500
OL,14,F"high growth firms" within 10 years.
OL,16,FSpeaking at Plaid's conference in
OL,17,FLlandudno, Conwy, Price is expected to
OL,18,Fannounce a new programme to help
OL,19,Fcompanies grow in size.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
