OL,3,GNEWSAPlaid aim for new Wales-based FTSE
OL,4,A100 company within 10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We should want more Welsh firms to
OL,7,Fsucceed, to grow and to compete on the
OL,8,Fworld stage," he will say.
